---
/**
 * /annual-report — year one in review.
 *
 * Honest framing: P31's 501(c)(3) determination is effective April 2026, so
 * the first Form 990 is due ~2027. This is the year-one narrative — what was
 * built, what shipped, what is real — not a 990-based financial report.
 * Every number is data-driven (flagships, papers) or from ground-truth.
 */
import MarketingShell from '../layouts/MarketingShell.astro';
import SectionHeader from '../components/marketing/SectionHeader.astro';
import Footer from '../components/marketing/Footer.astro';
import { FLAGSHIP_LIVE_COUNT, FLAGSHIPS } from '../data/flagships';
import { papers } from '../data/p31-research.ts';

const publishedCount = papers.length;
const liveFlagships = FLAGSHIPS.filter((f) => f.status === 'live');

const reportTimeline = `
timeline
    2026-01 : Tetrahedron Protocol published
    2026-03 : First flagship live (BONDING chemistry game)
    2026-04 : Incorporated as Georgia nonprofit
            : 501(c)(3) determination effective 2026-04-03
            : 21 papers uploaded to Zenodo
    2026-05 : Determination letter (947) received
    2026-06 : Privacy + terms policies effective
    2026-09 : Enterprise package v2.0
            : All ${publishedCount} DOIs verified live
`;
---

<MarketingShell
  title="Annual Report — P31 Labs"
  description="Year one in review: what was built, what shipped, what is real. P31 Labs, year one (2026)."
>
  <main id="main-content" class="section">
    <div class="anf3-max-w-4xl anf3-mx-auto anf3-px-6 anf3-md-px-12 anf3-lg-px-16">
      <SectionHeader
        level="1"
        title="Annual Report — Year One"
        description="What was built, what shipped, what is real. The first Form 990 is due ~2027; this is the year-one narrative, not a financial statement."
        align="left"
      />

      <div class="anf3-mt-16 anf3-space-y-8">

        {/* ── THE YEAR IN ONE SENTENCE ── */}
        <section class="glass-card">
          <div class="anf3-p-8 anf3-space-y-6">
            <h2 class="anf3-text-2xl anf3-font-bold" style="color: var(--p31-text);">The year, in one sentence</h2>
            <p class="anf3-text-xl anf3-leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--p31-text);">
              In year one, P31 Labs went from a family's lived need to an incorporated 501(c)(3) with
              <strong style="color: var(--p31-text);"> {liveFlagships.length} live flagship surfaces</strong>,
              <strong style="color: var(--p31-text);"> {publishedCount} open-access papers</strong>,
              and a proof layer anyone can verify in ninety seconds.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        {/* ── THE TIMELINE ── */}
        <section class="glass-card">
          <div class="anf3-p-8 anf3-space-y-6">
            <h2 class="anf3-text-2xl anf3-font-bold" style="color: var(--p31-text);">The year, in order</h2>
            <pre class="mermaid" set:html={reportTimeline} />
          </div>
        </section>

        {/* ── THE HEADLINES ── */}
        <section class="glass-card">
          <div class="anf3-p-8 anf3-space-y-6">
            <h2 class="anf3-text-2xl anf3-font-bold" style="color: var(--p31-text);">The headlines</h2>
            <div class="anf3-space-y-4">
              <div class="anf3-rounded-xl anf3-border anf3-p-5" style="border-color: var(--p31-glass-border, rgba(255,255,255,0.1)); background: var(--p31-panel-surface, rgba(255,255,255,0.04));">
                <div class="anf3-text-xs anf3-font-semibold anf3-tracking-widest anf3-uppercase" style="color: var(--p31-text-tertiary);">The identity</div>
                <div class="anf3-mt-1 anf3-text-base" style="color: var(--p31-text);">P31 Labs became a Georgia nonprofit corporation and received its 501(c)(3) determination — effective April 3, 2026, EIN 42-1888158.</div>
              </div>
              <div class="anf3-rounded-xl anf3-border anf3-p-5" style="border-color: var(--p31-glass-border, rgba(255,255,255,0.1)); background: var(--p31-panel-surface, rgba(255,255,255,0.04));">
                <div class="anf3-text-xs anf3-font-semibold anf3-tracking-widest anf3-uppercase" style="color: var(--p31-text-tertiary);">The research</div>
                <div class="anf3-mt-1 anf3-text-base" style="color: var(--p31-text);">{publishedCount} papers published on Zenodo — every DOI verified live. From the Tetrahedron Protocol to the Sovereign Stack.</div>
              </div>
              <div class="anf3-rounded-xl anf3-border anf3-p-5" style="border-color: var(--p31-glass-border, rgba(255,255,255,0.1)); background: var(--p31-panel-surface, rgba(255,255,255,0.04));">
                <div class="anf3-text-xs anf3-font-semibold anf3-tracking-widest anf3-uppercase" style="color: var(--p31-text-tertiary);">The flagships</div>
                <div class="anf3-mt-1 anf3-text-base" style="color: var(--p31-text);">{liveFlagships.length} live flagship surfaces — the Loom audit chain, Lumi identity, Governance, QPJ, CLI, MCP Marketplace, and Meatspace — with Spaceship Earth in vision.</div>
              </div>
              <div class="anf3-rounded-xl anf3-border anf3-p-5" style="border-color: var(--p31-glass-border, rgba(255,255,255,0.1)); background: var(--p31-panel-surface, rgba(255,255,255,0.04));">
                <div class="anf3-text-xs anf3-font-semibold anf3-tracking-widest anf3-uppercase" style="color: var(--p31-text-tertiary);">The proof layer</div>
                <div class="anf3-mt-1 anf3-text-base" style="color: var(--p31-text);">An audit chain you can verify in ninety seconds, post-quantum identity that lives on the device, and a governance layer aligned to active IETF standards.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        {/* ── THE HONEST FRAMING ── */}
        <section class="glass-card" style="border-left: 3px solid var(--p31-signal-amber, #f59e0b);">
          <div class="anf3-p-8 anf3-space-y-4">
            <h2 class="anf3-text-xl anf3-font-bold" style="color: var(--p31-text);">The honest framing</h2>
            <p class="anf3-text-base anf3-leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--p31-text-secondary);">
              This is a year-one narrative, not a 990-based financial report. The first Form 990 is due for fiscal year 2026, expected <strong style="color: var(--p31-text);">~2027</strong>. When it is filed, it will be posted here and on the <a href="/financials" style="color: var(--p31-accent);">Financials</a> page. Until then, the financial transparency floor is the <a href="/financials" style="color: var(--p31-accent);">registration facts</a> and the <a href="/treasury" style="color: var(--p31-accent);">live treasury ledger</a>.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        {/* ── CTA ── */}
        <section class="anf3-text-center anf3-py-6">
          <div class="anf3-flex anf3-flex-wrap anf3-justify-center anf3-gap-4">
            <a href="/treasury" class="anf3-inline-flex anf3-items-center anf3-gap-2 anf3-rounded-full anf3-px-6 anf3-py-3 anf3-text-sm anf3-font-semibold anf3-transition"
               style="background: var(--p31-accent, #22d3ee); color: #0a0a0f;">
              See the treasury →
            </a>
            <a href="/financials" class="anf3-inline-flex anf3-items-center anf3-gap-2 anf3-rounded-full anf3-px-6 anf3-py-3 anf3-text-sm anf3-font-semibold anf3-transition anf3-border"
               style="border-color: var(--p31-glass-border, rgba(255,255,255,0.16)); color: var(--p31-text);">
              Registration facts
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</MarketingShell>